# The MolNexTR plugin's environment: MolNexTR, which reads structures from
# pictures, for its worker (worker.py). Set up only when the plugin is added
# (docs/PLUGINS.md); its trained model is downloaded besides, by Meno
# (manifest.json, `downloads`).
#
# MolNexTR from its repository at a fixed commit, pinned by the archive's
# hash: it is not on PyPI. Its own requirements pin old releases (timm,
# albumentations, OpenNMT-py) and pyonmttok 1.37.1, which has no build for
# Python 3.12 - and which reading a picture never loads: overridden
# (overrides.txt), then left out.
#
# Locked for macOS and Windows (manifest.json, `systems`), with hashes, and
# with only what reading a picture loads and what that needs: OpenNMT-py's
# server and training, SmilesPE's training, PyTorch Lightning, and torch's
# GPU libraries for Linux are left out (--no-emit-package each; installed
# with --no-deps).
molnextr @ https://github.com/CYF2000127/MolNexTR/archive/6f6502b4ed9733dba8b1ee45d2da474576683194.tar.gz
torch
pillow
